Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 13:13:56 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 04/20] Add Claude Code plugin skeleton

A plugin that will show the status of Claude Code sessions, modeled on
iTerm2's Claude Code integration. This first version only proves the
pieces load:

- a "Claude Sessions" panel docked on the right, empty for now, toggled
  with Plugins > Show Claude Sessions (Ctrl+Shift+F3);
- a D-Bus object at /ClaudeCode on Konsole's service, interface
  org.kde.konsole.ClaudeCode, with ping() returning the plugin version
  and sessions() listing the session paths the plugin sees.

The plugin needs D-Bus and is built when ENABLE_PLUGIN_CLAUDECODE is on
(the default).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
